1 polymer     man 'Coagulation factor XIa heavy chain'     41262.098 1 3.4.21.27 ?     ? 
;Activated Recombinant Factor XI Ser557Ala. The molecule is a dimer that is disulphide linked at Cys321. During activation the bond at R369 is cleaved on each subunit to give a two chain molecule. only one monomer is solved here and is composed of a heavy chain (A) and light (B)
;
2 polymer     man 'Coagulation factor XIa light chain'     26686.352 1 ?         S557A ? 
;Activated Recombinant Factor XI Ser557Ala. The molecule is a dimer that is disulphide linked at Cys321. During activation the bond at R369 is cleaved on each subunit to give a two chain molecule. only one monomer is solved here and is composed of a heavy chain (A) and light (B)
;
3 polymer     nat 'Coagulation factor IXa light chain'     17033.383 1 ?         ?     ? 
'CGU are Glu residues with post-translational modification adding a carboxyl group to the gamma carbon of Glu' 
4 polymer     nat 'Coagulation factor IXa heavy chain'     26190.818 1 3.4.21.22 ?     ? ? 
5 non-polymer syn 2-acetamido-2-deoxy-beta-D-glucopyranose 221.208   4 ?         ?     ? ? 
