;FXIa is a dimer and binds 2 FIX molecules. Factor XIa used in this preparation is recombinant FXIa with a Ser557Ala mutation (mature protein numbering). recombinant protein is made as a zymogen that is activated. The activation involves cleavage after residue Arg369 of FXI to give FXIa
